le through the RHOAI build pipeline (build pipeline gate).\n- Rollback path: the previous ubi9 python base reference remains restorable.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 [P0]: All RHOAI runtime images must use a PQC-enabled base image — covers the python-variant-based images.\n- HLR-2 [P0]: Teams unable to comply by September 15 must file an OCP exception — unavailable variants route affected images to the exception path.\n- HLR-3 [P0]: PQC enablement is runtime only — final runtime stage only, no builder image change.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":59162,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b82c88193c77520","agent_id":"ae447954eeaf34fb2","session_id":"f2d69f1c-9b04-453b-94d6-4bb7c2d36986","uuid":"f4ee69f8-1e3e-44d3-8630-623a526c5d02","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:24:42.350Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8001"}
