eminders; leadership escalation for at-risk teams).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-2 [P0]: Teams unable to comply by September 15 must file an OCP exception with a remediation plan — this epic drives and verifies that guarantee.\n- HLR-1 [P0]: All RHOAI runtime images must use a PQC-enabled base image — the aggregated view tracks per-image completion of the switch wave.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":63143,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b82c88193c77520","agent_id":"ae447954eeaf34fb2","session_id":"f2d69f1c-9b04-453b-94d6-4bb7c2d36986","uuid":"1e916bac-10b4-4fc6-a441-c20e0bc63e0c","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:25:35.539Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-8001"}
