{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b7f700422e9fbf10","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-8001-E008\n3\ttitle: Switch python-variant-based images to PQC python base variants\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-8001\n5\tcomponent: Model Runtimes\n6\tteam: Model Serving\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-8001-E001\n11\tgated_by: RHAISTRAT-8001-E001\n12\tgate_failure_impact:\n13\t  action: remove\n14\t  fallback_approach: If PQC python base variants are not available by the deadline,\n15\t    the affected images stay on their current bases and the owning teams file OCP\n16\t    exceptions with documented remediation plans per HLR-2.\n17\tai_signals:\n18\t  change_specificity: 0\n19\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n20\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n21\t  existing_foundation: 1\n22\t  open_questions: -1\n23\t  external_dependency: -1\n24\t  human_process_gates: 0\n25\t  repo_access: 1\n26\t  architecture_claims: 1\n27\timplementation_type: null\n28\tinvestigation_signals: null\n29\tai_implementability: Medium\n30\tai_implementability_score: 2\n31\tjira_key: null\n32\tbranch: null\n33\t---\n34\t# Switch python-variant-based images to PQC python base variants\n35\t\n36\t## Description\n37\t\n38\tSwitch the roughly ten images currently built on `ubi9/python-311`, `ubi9/python-312`, and `ubi9/python-312-minimal` bases — training variants, lmes-job, and feature-server — to the corresponding PQC python base variants, changing only the final runtime stage of each image. This work is gated on the per-variant availability verdict for the PQC python bases tracked by the AIPCC spike RHOAIENG-7195.\n39\t\n40\t## Scope\n41\t\n42\t- Enumerate the python-variant-based images from the RHOAI 3.5 image inventory: training variants and lmes-job on python-311 (5 images), training variants on python-312 (4 images), feature-server on python-312-minimal (1 image).\n43\t- For each variant with a confirmed PQC base, switch the final runtime stage of the affected images to that variant; no builder image change.\n44\t- Re-run each image's existing validation against the new base.\n45\t- If a PQC variant is not available in time, support the owning teams' OCP-exception filings with TLS stack documentation and remediation plans — those images are tracked on the exception path for this release.\n46\t\n47\t## Acceptance Criteria\n48\t\n49\t- Every python-variant-based image in the RHOAI 3.6 payload either builds on its confirmed PQC python variant (runtime stage only) or has a filed OCP exception with a remediation plan.\n50\t- `update-crypto-policies --show` reports `DEFAULT:PQ` inside each switched image; the Python `cryptography` library continues to work against the system OpenSSL on the new base.\n51\t- Existing image validation passes on the new base.\n52\t- The PQC base variant is consumable through the RHOAI build pipeline (build pipeline gate).\n53\t- Rollback path: the previous ubi9 python base reference remains restorable.\n54\t\n55\t## HLR Traceability\n56\t\n57\t- HLR-1 [P0]: All RHOAI runtime images must use a PQC-enabled base image — covers the python-variant-based images.\n58\t- HLR-2 [P0]: Teams unable to comply by September 15 must file an OCP exception — unavailable variants route affected images to the exception path.\n59\t- HLR-3 [P0]: PQC enablement is runtime only — final runtime stage only, no builder image change.\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b1e60a45d5b7e82d","agent_id":"a9d1a007d1727a349","session_id":"f2d69f1c-9b04-453b-94d6-4bb7c2d36986","uuid":"7dc2a52a-c1e4-497d-bc4b-d3e13806bb3b","timestamp":"2026-10-22T07:36:06.219Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b7f700422e9fbf10","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-8001 decomposition"}
